|Magical Defence is based on 70% of your [[Magic]] level and 30% on your Defence<br/>[[File:Magic_defence icon.png]] = 70%[[File:Magic icon.png]] & 30% [[File:Defence icon.png]]
|}

'''Note: '''Certain [[special attack]]s of melee weapons can deal a magical-melee attack (the [[Saradomin sword]] for example).

==List of monsters that use magical-melee==

*[[Banshee]], [[Screaming banshee|Screaming Banshee]], [[Twisted Banshee]], and [[Screaming twisted banshee|Screaming Twisted Banshee]]
*[[Icefiend]], [[Pyrefiend]], [[Pyrelord]], [[Infernal pyrelord]], and [[Flaming pyrelord]]
*[[Bloodveld]], [[Insatiable Bloodveld]], [[Mutated Bloodveld]], [[Insatiable Mutated Bloodveld]], and [[Reanimated bloodveld|Reanimated Bloodveld]].
*[[Zygomite]] and [[Ancient Zygomite]]
*[[Cave horror]] and [[Cave abomination]]
*[[Jelly]], [[Vitreous Jelly]], [[Chilled jelly|Chilled Jelly]], [[Vitreous Chilled Jelly]], [[Warped Jelly]], and [[Vitreous warped Jelly|Vitreous Warped Jelly]]
*[[Moss Guardian]]

